          project site.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://scientificcomputing.rs/">Scientific Computing in Rust</a> &mdash; a free
          annual online workshop out of UCL with a monthly newsletter and every talk on YouTube. This
          is where the numerical and GPU work gets presented.
        </li>
    </ul>
